WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:43.130
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:43.400 --> 01:46.900
"The Missing Piece"

3
01:47.100 --> 01:51.800
(Episode 8)

4
01:55.799 --> 01:56.799
Zhou Yang

5
01:57.079 --> 01:58.079
Zhou Yang is back

6
02:05.439 --> 02:06.439
Zhou Yang

7
02:07.200 --> 02:08.200
You're back

8
02:09.360 --> 02:10.400
I'm not Zhou Yang

9
02:13.599 --> 02:14.680
Haven't seen you in days

10
02:14.680 --> 02:15.879
You got a bit more handsome

11
02:15.879 --> 02:16.319
What

12
02:16.319 --> 02:18.376
So if you got handsome, you're not Zhou Yang anymore

13
02:18.400 --> 02:20.560
Besides, if you're not Zhou Yang, who are you

14
02:26.479 --> 02:27.479
Oh

15
02:27.840 --> 02:29.280
The house is a bit messy

16
02:29.840 --> 02:31.319
I haven't really tidied up

17
02:33.680 --> 02:34.680
Ah

18
02:35.199 --> 02:37.319
Didn't you say you were only going out for a few days

19
02:38.159 --> 02:39.719
How come you're back so late

20
02:41.280 --> 02:42.400
I'm not Zhou Yang

21
02:46.120 --> 02:47.120
A couple days ago

22
02:48.639 --> 02:50.639
Someone found this in an old warehouse

23
02:51.800 --> 02:52.919
I figured it might be yours

24
02:53.960 --> 02:55.199
So I brought it over

25
02:56.560 --> 02:57.560
It really is

26
02:57.919 --> 02:58.800
Look at me

27
02:58.800 --> 03:00.120
So forgetful

28
03:02.159 --> 03:03.159
Good thing I have you

29
03:05.960 --> 03:06.960
Hey

30
03:07.479 --> 03:08.560
You haven't eaten yet, right

31
03:08.560 --> 03:09.560
Let's eat together

32
03:15.639 --> 03:17.840
You just keep eating this moldy, spoiled stuff

33
03:21.000 --> 03:22.000
Is it moldy

34
03:24.280 --> 03:26.056
I think there's still some food in the fridge

35
03:26.080 --> 03:27.400
Let me cook you a bowl of noodles

36
03:35.120 --> 03:37.440
Maybe I just haven't been resting well these past few days

37
03:38.360 --> 03:39.599
Sorry, Yang

38
04:10.840 --> 04:11.960
Bought a bowl of porridge

39
04:18.839 --> 04:20.120
If I hadn't come today

40
04:21.800 --> 04:23.720
You'd probably starve to death in this room

41
04:25.959 --> 04:27.919
Then in a few days you'd be on the news headlines

42
05:05.560 --> 05:06.560
Heh

43
05:19.480 --> 05:21.000
Have you been taking your meds on time

44
05:25.480 --> 05:26.519
I'm not sick

45
05:31.120 --> 05:31.680
Okay, okay

46
05:31.680 --> 05:32.839
I'll take them

47
05:39.600 --> 05:40.600
Yang

48
05:41.519 --> 05:42.519
Where are you going

49
05:47.480 --> 05:49.040
I just happened to pass by today

50
05:50.079 --> 05:51.480
I won't come back again

51
06:02.399 --> 06:03.800
And of course Yang won't either

52
06:04.160 --> 06:05.319
Keep running away

53
06:07.120 --> 06:08.959
Or wake up and face reality

54
06:08.959 --> 06:10.079
You choose

55
06:51.879 --> 06:53.680
Did I do something wrong again?

56
06:53.959 --> 06:55.319
That's why Yang left

57
06:58.800 --> 07:00.560
Maybe I've really lost my mind

58
07:01.240 --> 07:02.360
But I can't leave

59
07:02.839 --> 07:03.839
I have to wait for him

60
07:06.839 --> 07:07.959
If I leave

61
07:08.439 --> 07:10.120
Yang won't find me when he comes back

62
07:36.199 --> 07:37.199
Yang

63
07:38.279 --> 07:39.279
Yang, you're back

64
07:43.600 --> 07:44.800
Yang went abroad

65
07:57.480 --> 07:58.480
He's not coming back

66
08:03.600 --> 08:04.600
Forget him

67
08:07.759 --> 08:09.279
You should start a new life

68
08:11.600 --> 08:12.879
I'm just glad you're back

69
08:16.360 --> 08:17.360
I'm just glad you're back

70
08:50.480 --> 08:52.120
You seem to have a fever

71
09:16.000 --> 09:17.720
Cancel my business trip tomorrow

72
09:18.279 --> 09:19.279
Something came up

73
09:39.240 --> 09:40.240
Yang, don't go

74
09:42.919 --> 09:43.919
Yang

75
09:46.279 --> 09:47.360
Yang, don't go

76
10:17.200 --> 10:18.399
Why are you up so early?

77
10:18.399 --> 10:19.480
Go get some more sleep

78
10:19.600 --> 10:21.240
With you here, I sleep so soundly

79
10:21.240 --> 10:22.480
That's why I wake up early

80
10:23.480 --> 10:24.679
You're still sick

81
10:26.360 --> 10:27.360
Come on

82
10:28.320 --> 10:29.320
Sleep a bit more

83
11:19.639 --> 11:20.639
What's going on

84
11:29.320 --> 11:31.160
Let me tell you again how to take the medicine

85
11:32.399 --> 11:33.480
Remember it this time

86
11:35.559 --> 11:36.559
This bottle

87
11:36.799 --> 11:37.960
Take it after meals

88
11:38.320 --> 11:39.320
Twice a day

89
11:39.799 --> 11:40.799
Two pills each time

90
11:42.080 --> 11:43.919
This bottle is for bedtime every night

91
11:44.039 --> 11:45.360
One pill each time is enough

92
11:45.639 --> 11:46.639
And also

93
11:51.279 --> 11:52.279
Got all that?

94
11:53.480 --> 11:54.480
Mm

95
11:56.600 --> 11:57.600
These

96
11:58.480 --> 11:59.480
Oh

97
12:00.159 --> 12:01.559
Your place is way too messy

98
12:02.799 --> 12:04.279
Even I can't stand it

99
12:05.159 --> 12:06.360
I'll come by in three days

100
12:07.720 --> 12:09.240
Take you to the hospital for a checkup

101
12:09.960 --> 12:11.120
You're leaving again?

102
12:15.720 --> 12:17.000
Something came up at the company

103
12:21.679 --> 12:22.679
Ma'am

104
12:23.320 --> 12:26.080
Could I trouble you to come cook for the next few days

105
12:27.960 --> 12:29.399
Just send me the bill

106
12:29.399 --> 12:30.399
Okay

107
12:31.960 --> 12:32.960
Yang

108
12:41.720 --> 12:42.720
Stop talking

109
12:44.840 --> 12:48.080
Remember to take your medicine after you eat

110
13:04.200 --> 13:06.360
Didn't he say he'd come in three days

111
13:08.519 --> 13:09.840
Why isn't he here yet

112
13:19.200 --> 13:20.200
Why are you here

113
13:21.240 --> 13:24.039
We agreed I'd bring you for a checkup in three days

114
13:26.519 --> 13:27.879
I don't even remember

115
13:28.200 --> 13:29.440
I was sleeping

116
13:30.840 --> 13:32.559
You sleep dressed this formally?

117
13:37.440 --> 13:38.440
Ah

118
13:40.159 --> 13:41.600
Come on, give me some dignity

119
13:41.879 --> 13:44.015
Otherwise I'd have to say I've been waiting for you this whole time

120
13:44.039 --> 13:45.039
So embarrassing

121
13:49.080 --> 13:50.080
Mr. Shen

122
13:50.480 --> 13:51.480
And this is

123
13:55.039 --> 13:56.039
This is Zhou Yang

124
13:56.440 --> 13:57.480
He's my love

125
13:59.440 --> 14:00.600
But from what I know

126
14:01.120 --> 14:03.559
Mr. Zhou Yang doesn't look like this

127
14:03.559 --> 14:05.759
And he's not as tall as this gentleman either

128
14:07.240 --> 14:08.240
Doctor

129
14:09.320 --> 14:10.600
People change

130
14:11.759 --> 14:13.200
He went abroad

131
14:13.799 --> 14:15.200
Of course he'd change

132
14:16.200 --> 14:19.720
And no matter what he becomes

133
14:20.159 --> 14:21.440
I'll always recognize him

134
14:26.960 --> 14:28.039
So, Mr. Shen

135
14:28.360 --> 14:32.480
Are you sure this man next to you is Zhou Yang?

136
14:33.240 --> 14:34.240
Of course

137
14:35.360 --> 14:36.960
How many years have we known each other?

138
14:37.759 --> 14:38.480
No, doctor

139
14:38.480 --> 14:39.519
The questions you're asking today

140
14:39.519 --> 14:41.039
Why are they all so strange?

141
14:42.279 --> 14:43.320
Alright, Mr. Shen

142
14:43.360 --> 14:44.360
I understand

143
14:47.600 --> 14:48.600
Shen Mo

144
14:49.679 --> 14:51.399
Wait outside for me for a bit

145
14:52.279 --> 14:53.440
I'll be right there

146
14:55.960 --> 14:56.960
Oh

147
15:05.720 --> 15:06.720
Mr. Ji

148
15:06.759 --> 15:07.799
You saw it too

149
15:08.360 --> 15:09.360
Mr. Shen's condition

150
15:09.360 --> 15:10.360
Just tell me straight

151
15:11.960 --> 15:14.679
The patient has a very severe post-traumatic stress reaction

152
15:14.960 --> 15:16.039
Deep down

153
15:16.039 --> 15:17.200
he's been running from it

154
15:17.240 --> 15:19.000
the fact that Yang abandoned him

155
15:19.559 --> 15:21.960
So he takes you, who's by his side

156
15:21.960 --> 15:23.639
as a stand-in for Yang

157
15:24.279 --> 15:26.879
This is Mr. Shen's self-protection mechanism

158
15:28.960 --> 15:29.960
I understand

159
15:30.679 --> 15:32.480
But if you don't expose him

160
15:32.480 --> 15:33.759
and don't tell him the truth

161
15:34.279 --> 15:37.120
it could get worse and worse

162
15:37.279 --> 15:40.960
he might even see you as Zhou Yang forever

163
15:42.279 --> 15:44.480
So what happens if I do expose him

164
15:44.840 --> 15:45.919
He might break down

165
15:46.559 --> 15:48.559
Or he might be fine

166
15:49.159 --> 15:50.399
No one can say for sure

167
15:51.879 --> 15:53.960
Then how do we treat it

168
15:55.159 --> 15:58.480
Healing a mental illness is a long process

169
15:58.840 --> 16:01.519
And no one can guarantee it'll work

170
16:02.320 --> 16:04.559
All you can do is stay by his side

171
16:04.559 --> 16:04.960
Oh

172
16:04.960 --> 16:05.240
Right

173
16:05.240 --> 16:05.960
Remember

174
16:06.039 --> 16:08.919
You must keep his emotions stable

175
16:09.919 --> 16:11.080
That's all for now

176
16:12.000 --> 16:16.080
He can't take another breakdown right now

177
16:16.720 --> 16:17.720
Mr. Ji

178
16:17.960 --> 16:19.840
I still want to remind you

179
16:20.120 --> 16:21.519
You'd better think it through

180
16:30.559 --> 16:31.639
I owe him

181
16:35.720 --> 16:36.519
Done talking

182
16:36.679 --> 16:37.679
Mm

183
16:39.960 --> 16:41.080
What did you two talk about?

184
16:41.840 --> 16:43.279
The doctor said you're fine

185
16:43.440 --> 16:45.039
Just take your meds on time

186
16:46.240 --> 16:47.399
See, I told you

187
16:47.639 --> 16:49.679
Doctors always have to ask this and that

188
16:51.240 --> 16:52.240
Don't worry

189
16:52.360 --> 16:53.559
I'm not worried at all

190
16:53.559 --> 16:54.559
Let's go

191
16:56.840 --> 16:57.440
Yang

192
16:57.440 --> 16:58.440
Where are we going?

193
16:59.799 --> 17:00.799
Taking you home

194
17:01.799 --> 17:02.799
You're so good to me

195
17:37.799 --> 17:38.960
Sorry about that

196
17:39.680 --> 17:41.400
I think I fell asleep

197
17:45.359 --> 17:46.640
Why are we pulled over?

198
17:48.759 --> 17:49.960
Didn't want to wake you

199
17:51.079 --> 17:52.079
Had a nightmare

200
17:56.559 --> 17:57.559
Often?

201
17:59.519 --> 18:00.519
Now and then

202
18:03.640 --> 18:04.640
Look at me

203
18:06.640 --> 18:08.000
You've been looking so pale lately

204
18:08.720 --> 18:10.136
Is it because you're scared to sleep

205
18:10.160 --> 18:10.920
No

206
18:10.920 --> 18:11.920
Then why

207
18:13.039 --> 18:14.720
It's just that when I close my eyes

208
18:14.720 --> 18:16.480
I see all these strange

209
18:16.480 --> 18:17.519
terrifying dreams

210
18:19.319 --> 18:20.480
Why didn't you tell me

211
18:21.400 --> 18:22.839
I didn't want you to worry

212
18:23.759 --> 18:25.200
Has it been like this every night

213
18:26.680 --> 18:27.799
Not always

214
18:28.680 --> 18:31.079
Last time you stayed with me, I could sleep

215
18:48.240 --> 18:49.039
Yang

216
18:49.160 --> 18:50.240
Where are we going

217
18:50.559 --> 18:52.159
You're driving the wrong way, aren't you

218
18:52.720 --> 18:53.720
No, I'm not

219
18:54.680 --> 18:55.720
Then where are we going

220
18:57.359 --> 18:58.359
My place

221
18:59.240 --> 19:01.359
You shouldn't be alone in that room

222
19:01.400 --> 19:02.400
No

223
19:02.559 --> 19:03.559
Why

224
19:04.240 --> 19:05.240
No

225
19:05.640 --> 19:06.680
I have to go home

226
19:06.680 --> 19:07.680
I still have to wait

227
19:15.839 --> 19:16.839
Wait

228
19:16.880 --> 19:17.880
Waiting for what

229
19:18.079 --> 19:19.079
Waiting for Yang

230
19:19.400 --> 19:21.079
But Yang is already by my side

231
19:22.240 --> 19:23.640
Then what am I waiting for

232
19:25.000 --> 19:26.200
You really won't come with me

233
19:29.799 --> 19:30.799
Yang

234
19:32.559 --> 19:34.039
Let's go home, okay

235
19:35.119 --> 19:36.759
It's our home

236
19:39.480 --> 19:40.480
Okay

237
19:43.599 --> 19:44.599
Back to your home

238
19:44.640 --> 19:45.720
What do you mean, your home

239
19:46.119 --> 19:47.559
What are you talking about

240
19:48.799 --> 19:50.119
That's our home

241
20:20.559 --> 20:26.960
The ferris wheel spins but never reaches the clouds

242
20:27.279 --> 20:29.799
We sit side by side

243
20:29.799 --> 20:34.759
Only seeing each other's loneliness

244
20:35.440 --> 20:38.119
That beautiful place

245
20:38.440 --> 20:42.599
Is probably still on the next round

246
20:42.839 --> 20:48.599
Too bad no one has the strength to wait for it to turn

247
20:56.240 --> 20:57.840
How come you walk without making a sound

248
21:00.400 --> 21:01.400
It's beautiful

249
21:03.000 --> 21:04.640
That's not what you used to say

250
21:05.960 --> 21:07.440
You even said you'd teach me

251
21:10.480 --> 21:11.480
I really like it

252
21:11.920 --> 21:12.920
Really

253
21:13.240 --> 21:15.160
Then I'll sing it for you all the time, okay

254
21:15.599 --> 21:16.599
Okay

255
21:17.599 --> 21:18.920
But it's really late now

256
21:19.920 --> 21:21.000
You should go to sleep

257
21:23.160 --> 21:24.160
Okay

258
21:43.200 --> 21:44.000
Yang

259
21:44.119 --> 21:45.400
Why won't you sleep with me

260
21:47.279 --> 21:48.359
Don't ask so many questions

261
21:49.119 --> 21:50.759
Did you forget something

262
21:51.039 --> 21:52.039
Mm

263
21:54.440 --> 21:55.880
Did you forget to take your medicine

264
22:28.839 --> 22:30.359
Were you always this obedient before

265
22:30.440 --> 22:32.200
Don't you know how I used to be

266
22:32.319 --> 22:33.519
Is there a big difference

267
22:37.680 --> 22:38.680
Never mind

268
22:38.920 --> 22:39.920
Let's sleep

269
22:40.920 --> 22:41.920
Okay

270
22:42.480 --> 22:43.480
Good night

271
22:45.480 --> 22:46.480
Good night

272
23:14.119 --> 23:15.480
In your eyes

273
23:16.160 --> 23:17.680
Is everyone Yang

274
23:18.960 --> 23:20.319
Or do you only see me as him

275
23:21.200 --> 23:22.319
I like you

276
23:26.240 --> 23:27.240
Yang

277
23:31.039 --> 23:32.039
I'm right here

278
23:32.519 --> 23:33.519
Go to sleep

279
23:39.720 --> 23:40.720
You're awake

280
23:41.319 --> 23:42.359
Get up and eat

281
23:49.400 --> 23:51.039
Try it, see if my cooking's improved

282
24:19.119 --> 24:20.119
Is it good?

283
24:23.119 --> 24:24.119
Just okay

284
24:25.240 --> 24:27.599
Well, it can't compare to fancy delicacies

285
24:45.799 --> 24:46.799
Mr. Ji

286
24:50.000 --> 24:50.599
Mr. Ji

287
24:50.599 --> 24:51.599
Take a look

288
24:52.640 --> 24:53.640
Enough

289
24:53.880 --> 24:55.000
Handle it yourself

290
25:12.279 --> 25:13.399
What are you thinking about?

291
25:15.319 --> 25:16.440
I was thinking

292
25:17.319 --> 25:18.759
Why won't you sleep with me

293
25:22.039 --> 25:22.519
Uh

294
25:22.519 --> 25:23.879
You're still not over your illness

295
25:24.000 --> 25:24.599
I

296
25:24.599 --> 25:24.920
Ah

297
25:24.920 --> 25:25.976
I've just been too busy with work

298
25:26.000 --> 25:26.680
This

299
25:26.960 --> 25:28.360
This couch is actually pretty comfy

300
25:29.640 --> 25:31.640
You're sleeping with me tonight, no matter what

301
25:45.880 --> 25:46.880
I'm impotent

302
25:47.440 --> 25:48.440
Happy now

303
26:35.480 --> 26:36.039
Alright

304
26:36.039 --> 26:37.039
Go to work

305
26:37.839 --> 26:38.839
Okay

306
26:39.319 --> 26:40.440
Then be good at home

307
26:40.759 --> 26:41.759
Don't worry

308
26:42.160 --> 26:42.960
I promise when you get home

309
26:42.960 --> 26:44.440
you'll have the hottest meal waiting

310
26:44.720 --> 26:46.360
As long as you take good care of yourself

311
26:46.720 --> 26:48.000
I'm already happy

312
26:48.799 --> 26:50.079
Who are you looking down on

313
26:51.359 --> 26:53.160
After tonight's meeting I'm free

314
26:54.640 --> 26:55.720
Shouldn't be home too late

315
26:56.799 --> 26:57.799
Okay

316
27:08.640 --> 27:09.720
Yang is so good
